  m_Name: SmashInfo
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::WorkshopExampleInfo
  m_Scene: {fileID: 102900000, guid: 4e4c85acd81c4584596813087ba15380, type: 3}
  m_ScenePath: Assets/Examples/Smash/Smash.unity
  m_ExampleName: Smash
  m_Category: Benchmarks
  m_Purpose: "Stress-tests a huge number of bodies waking at once, and a huge number of contacts being created and solved at the same moment.\nOne large dense box is fired across a room with no gravity into a field of thousands of small sleeping boxes."
  m_Controls: "Speed and Density: how fast and how heavy the large box is.\nBounciness: how bouncy everything is.\nSpacing: how far apart the small boxes are.\nCollision Threshold: the body setting that decides when continuous collision is used. Whether a shape is using continuous collision detection (CCD) is shown by its color, which can be configured on the physics world.\nEvery change rebuilds the scene."
  m_Description: A large dense body smashing through a field of small boxes.
